Web-ready project photography goes here.

Export selected shots from photos-source/ as WebP/AVIF — hero ~1600px wide,
project cards ~800px wide — and name them descriptively, e.g.
hero-cinema-room.webp, project-residential-windermere.webp.

See PHOTO_MANIFEST.md for the source inventory and which originals are
high-res enough to use. src/data/projects.ts already references the
expected filenames.
